<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Kairo — {{.Host}}</title>
<style>
  :root{--bg:#0d1117;--card:#161b22;--border:#30363d;--fg:#e6edf3;--muted:#8b949e;--accent:#58a6ff;--good:#3fb950;--warn:#d29922}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:15px/1.6 -apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
  .wrap{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:48px 20px}
  h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 4px}
  .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 28px}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:28px}
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px}
  .card .k{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em}
  .card .v{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;word-break:break-all}
  .card .v a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
  .card .v a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
  .badge{display:inline-block;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(63,185,80,.15);color:var(--good);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}
  .badge-warn{background:rgba(210,153,34,.15);color:var(--warn)}
  h2{font-size:14px;margin:26px 0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
  code{background:#0d1117;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:2px 6px;font-size:13px}
  ul{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:20px}
  li{margin:6px 0}
  .foot{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:32px}
  .health{margin-top:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;background:var(--card)}
  .health .ok{color:var(--good)} .health .warn{color:var(--warn)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Kairo</h1>
  <p class="sub">Transparent domain-based split routing — DNS policy, DoH/DoT and SNI proxy in one binary.</p>

  <div class="badge">operational</div>
  <div style="margin-top:12px" class="badge-warn" id="health-badge">health: <a href="/healthz?format=json" style="color:inherit">/healthz</a> → <span id="health-status">checking...</span></div>
  <script>fetch('/healthz?detailed=1',{headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}}).then(r=>r.json()).then(j=>{document.getElementById('health-status').textContent=j.ok?'ok':'degraded';document.getElementById('health-status').className=j.ok?'ok':'warn'}).catch(()=>{document.getElementById('health-status').textContent='unknown'})</script>

  <div class="grid" style="margin-top:18px">
    <div class="card"><div class="k">Version</div><div class="v">{{.Version}}</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">Host</div><div class="v">{{.Host}}</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">VPS IP</div><div class="v">{{.VPSIP}}</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">Admin URL</div><div class="v"><a href="{{.AdminURL}}">{{.AdminURL}}</a></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">DoH URL</div><div class="v"><a href="{{.DoHURL}}">{{.DoHURL}}</a></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">Uptime</div><div class="v">{{.Uptime}}</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">Allowlisted clients</div><div class="v">{{.AllowedCount}}</div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="k">Restricted domains</div><div class="v">{{.RestrictedCount}}</div></div>
  </div>

  <h2>DNS endpoints</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Plain DNS: <code>{{.PlainDNSEndpoint}}</code> (use <code>{{.VPSIP}}:53</code> for plain)</li>
    <li>DNS over HTTPS: <code>{{.DoHEndpoint}}</code></li>
    <li>DNS over TLS: <code>{{.DoTEndpoint}}</code></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>API</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Auth: <code>POST /api/auth/login</code> → <code>kairo_session</code>, <code>GET /api/auth/me</code>, <code>POST /api/auth/logout</code></li>
    <li>Public config: <code>GET /api/public-config</code> (any auth, returns admin_url/doh_url/vps_ip)</li>
    <li>Allow a client: <code>POST /api/allow?ip=1.2.3.4</code> (admin or self-IP via Bearer)</li>
    <li>List allowlist: <code>GET /api/allow</code> (admin)</li>
    <li>Manage domains: <code>POST /api/restricted?domain=example.com</code> (admin)</li>
    <li>Check domain: <code>GET /api/domain/check?domain=example.com</code> (any auth)</li>
    <li>Request domain: <code>POST /api/domain/request {"domain":"example.com"}</code> (any auth)</li>
    <li>List requests: <code>GET /api/domain/requests</code> (admin)</li>
    <li>Approve/reject: <code>POST /api/domain/requests/:id/approve|reject</code> (admin)</li>
    <li>Traffic: <code>GET /api/traffic</code> (admin) / <code>GET /api/me/traffic</code> (self)</li>
    <li>Health: <code>GET /healthz?detailed=1</code> → JSON with db + counts; <code>GET /?format=json</code> same</li>
    <li>Status: <code>GET /api/status</code> (admin)</li>
    <li>Users: <code>GET /api/users</code>, <code>POST /api/users</code> (rate_limit 0 = unlimited), <code>POST /api/users/:id/rate-limit {"rate_limit":0}</code>, <code>DELETE /api/users/:id</code></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="health">
    <div class="k">Health</div>
    <div>Check <code>/healthz</code> (plain ok) or <code>/healthz?detailed=1</code> (JSON with <code>checks.database</code>, <code>allowlisted</code>, <code>restricted</code>). For API: <code>/api/public-config</code> and <code>/api/traffic</code>.</div>
  </div>

  <p class="foot">Panel: <a href="{{.AdminURL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{.AdminURL}}</a> · Health: <code>/healthz</code> · Configure clients to use {{.VPSIP}} as DNS or {{.DoHURL}} for DoH.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
